      <description><![CDATA[
<h2>Pot now updates itself</h2>
<ul>
  <li>New versions install automatically: Pot checks once a day and installs when its window is closed.</li>
  <li>Prefer to choose? Settings → Updates → turn off <em>Update Pot automatically</em> and use <em>Check for updates…</em>.</li>
  <li>Updates are verified with Pot's own signature. The check sends only the version number.</li>
</ul>
